.SYNOPSIS

List devices

.DESCRIPTION

This API returns a list of devices.   A caller who owns the devices can list them. Other callers need the **idn:mis-identity:read** right. A caller without that right must filter the request to devices they own, for example `owners.primaryIdentity.id eq ""me""`; if any returned device is not owned by the caller, this API returns `403`. In `owners.primaryIdentity.id` and `owners.secondaryIdentity.id` filters, the value `me` resolves to the calling identity.   Source sub-admins only see devices on the sources they manage.   When Machine Identity Security is not enabled for the tenant, this API returns `404`. When the devices API is not enabled for the tenant, this API returns `403`. 

